# @<%= packageName %>/utils

Shared utility helpers for the **<%= appTitle %>** monorepo.
Depends on `@<%= packageName %>/core` via `workspace:*`.

## Install

```bash
pnpm add @<%= packageName %>/utils
```

## Usage

```ts
import {shout, makeGreeter} from '@<%= packageName %>/utils';

console.log(shout('hello')); // HELLO!
const greeter = makeGreeter('Hey');
console.log(greeter.greet('World')); // Hey, World!
```

## Scripts

```bash
pnpm build       # build dist/ via <%= libBundlerName %>
pnpm dev         # watch-rebuild
pnpm typecheck   # tsc --noEmit
```

